    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21866" root="شحو" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَحًا</span></b> , (K,) thus with the short <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ا</span>, (TA,) <i>Wide;</i>
applied to anything: and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَحْوَآءُ</span></b> , applied to a
well, signifies the same: (K:) or the latter, thus
applied, <i>wide in the head</i> [or <i>upper part</i>]. (TA.)

